Miimansa's modifications add row-level traceability to the data quality checks:
capturing the records that cause a check to fail, writing them to a separate
row-level violations file, and persisting them to database tables. Files that
Miimansa changed or added are marked as such in their headers. The full list of
changes is in NEWS.md.
